OL,3,GNEWSAArrests as barbecue thought to
OL,4,Ahave caused flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have arrested two people on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a flat fire
OL,8,Fwhich is believed to have started when
OL,9,Fa barbecue was lit on furniture.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to reports of a fire in Burns
OL,13,FStreet, Ilkeston, at 16:40 BST on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FA man and a woman, both in their 30s,
OL,17,Fwere arrested at the scene on suspicion
OL,18,Fof arson. They both remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
